{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_025DF0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"加勒比海沿岸的低地大多是高温多湿的热带雨林，也就是大多数人想象中的“丛林”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"树木为了争夺阳光密集生长，在高处枝繁叶茂。地面附近很昏暗，要小心。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"不过，因为阳光照不到，地表反而很少长植物，也许会更好走一些。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":"AUX_WALKABILITY_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"也就是说，就算能进行光合作用，也派不上用场。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"光合作用？人类又不会光合作用。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"普通人是不会……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":"JPN_ELLIPTICAL_TONE_PRIMARY"}]}